"row mb-4 p-3 bg-light rounded"><div class="col-md-4"><label for="brandFilter" class="form-label">Brand</label><select id="brandFilter" class="form-select"><option value="all" selected="">All Brands</option><option value="Aiper">Aiper</option><option value="BWT">BWT</option><option value="Beatbot">Beatbot</option><option value="Dolphin">Dolphin</option><option value="Hayward">Hayward</option><option value="Pentair">Pentair</option><option value="Polaris">Polaris</option></select></div><div class="col-md-4"><label for="priceFilter" class="form-label">Max Price: <span>Any</span></label><input type="range" class="form-range" min="500" max="2000" step="100" id="priceFilter" value="2000"/></div></div><div class="row"><div class="col-md-6 mb-4"><div class="card h-100"><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column"><div class="d-flex mb-3"><div class="flex-shrink-0 me-3" style="width:100px;height:100px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><img src="https://brand.maytronics.com/m/4f1de64dc1be474a/EP_Large-Dolphin-Nautilus-CC-Plus-2025.webp" alt="Dolphin Nautilus CC Plus" class="img-fluid rounded" style="max-height:100%;max-width:100%;object-fit:contain"/></div><div><h5 class="card-title">Dolphin Nautilus CC Plus</h5><p class="card-text small text-muted">A popular choice for many pool owners. It features clever cleaning technology and easy-to-clean filters.</p></div></div><p class="card-text fw-bold mt-auto">Approx. Price: $<!-- -->799</p><div class="d-flex gap-2"><a class="btn btn-outline-primary flex-grow-1" href="/reviews/Dolphin-Nautilus-CC-Plus">Read Review</a><a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00Q8M0NWE?tag=scorpiusllc-20" target="_blank" class="btn btn-warning flex-grow-1 fw-bold ">Check Price</a></div></div></div></div><div class="col-md-6 mb-4"><div class="card h-100"><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column"><div class="d-flex mb-3"><div class="flex-shrink-0 me-3" style="width:100px;height:100px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><img src="https://brand.maytronics.com/m/a588d1bffdb4c27/EP_Medium-Dolphin-Premier.jpg" alt="Dolphin Premier" class="img-fluid rounded" style="max-height:100%;max-width:100%;object-fit:contain"/></div><div><h5 class="card-title">Dolphin Premier</h5><p class="card-text small text-muted">Features multi-media filtration and an anti-tangle swivel cable, making it a top-tier choice.</p></div></div><p class="card-text fw-bold mt-auto">Approx. Price: $<!-- -->1599</p><div class="d-flex gap-2"><a class="btn btn-outline-primary flex-grow-1" href="/reviews/Dolphin-Premier">Read Review</a><a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0124QB2EU?tag=scorpiusllc-20" target="_blank" class="btn btn-warning flex-grow-1 fw-bold ">Check Price</a></div></div></div></div><div class="col-md-6 mb-4"><div class="card h-100"><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column"><div class="d-flex mb-3"><div class="flex-shrink-0 me-3" style="width:100px;height:100px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><img src="https://www.maytronics.com/dw/image/v2/BGGP_PRD/on/demandware.static/-/Library-Sites-MaytronicsSharedLibrary/default/dw67795726/MTNA/Excci_Titan_Image_OnWhite%20673x850.jpg" alt="Dolphin Nautilus Titan" class="img-fluid rounded" style="max-height:100%;max-width:100%;object-fit:contain"/></div><div><h5 class="card-title">Dolphin Nautilus Titan</h5><p class="card-text small text-muted">The newest evolution of the Nautilus line, featuring Wi-Fi connectivity and enhanced agility.</p></div></div><p class="card-text fw-bold mt-auto">Approx. Price: $<!-- -->1599</p><div class="d-flex gap-2"><a class="btn btn-outline-primary flex-grow-1" href="/reviews/Dolphin-Nautilus-Titan">Read Review</a><a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XFCQJPH?tag=scorpiusllc-20" target="_blank" class="btn btn-warning flex-grow-1 fw-bold ">Check Price</a></div></div></div></div><div class="col-md-6 mb-4"><div class="card h-100"><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column"><div class="d-flex mb-3"><div class="flex-shrink-0 me-3" style="width:100px;height:100px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><img src="https://brand.maytronics.com/m/3b41b1f63de46e30/EP_Medium-Dolphin-Sigma.jpg" alt="Dolphin Sigma" class="img-fluid rounded" style="max-height:100%;max-width:100%;object-fit:contain"/></div><div><h5 class="card-title">Dolphin Sigma</h5><p class="card-text small text-muted">A high-end model with a gyroscope and triple motors for unparalleled navigation and cleaning coverage.</p></div></div><p class="card-text fw-bold mt-auto">Approx. Price: $<!-- -->1899</p><div class="d-flex gap-2"><a class="btn btn-outline-primary flex-grow-1" href="/reviews/Dolphin-Sigma">Read Review</a><a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CZ1XVZX?tag=scorpiusllc-20" target="_blank" class="btn btn-warning flex-grow-1 fw-bold ">Check Price</a></div></div></div></div><div class="col-md-6 mb-4"><div class="card h-100"><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column"><div class="d-flex mb-3"><div class="flex-shrink-0 me-3" style="width:100px;height:100px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><img src="https://cdn.fluidrausa.com/-/media/media-database/products/cleaners/polaris-9650iq/26_polaris_9650iqmmin.png?rev=b52abb68ba60459dad6096751a68b7c6" alt="Polaris 9650iQ Sport" class="img-fluid rounded" style="max-height:100%;max-width:100%;object-fit:contain"/></div><div><h5 class="card-title">Polaris 9650iQ Sport</h5><p class="card-text small text-muted">This smart cleaner connects to Wi-Fi and can be controlled via an app. Excellent for tech-savvy users.</p></div></div><p class="card-text fw-bold mt-auto">Approx. Price: $<!-- -->1099</p><div class="d-flex gap-2"><a class="btn btn-outline-primary flex-grow-1" href="/reviews/Polaris-9650iQ-Sport">Read Review</a><a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H5X1WZ9?tag=scorpiusllc-20" target="_blank" class="btn btn-warning flex-grow-1 fw-bold ">Check Price</a></div></div></div></div><div class="col-md-6 mb-4"><div class="card h-100"><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column"><div class="d-flex mb-3"><div class="flex-shrink-0 me-3" style="width:100px;height:100px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><img src="https://cdn.fluidrausa.com/-/media/media-database/products/cleaners/polaris-9550/polaris9550_remote.png?rev=f5eabf30e6324ca294ee427932e2dc1c" alt="Polaris F9550 Sport" class="img-fluid rounded" style="max-height:100%;max-width:100%;object-fit:contain"/></div><div><h5 class="card-title">Polaris F9550 Sport</h5><p class="card-text small text-muted">Features a rear water propulsion system that allows it to reach debris under stairs and in tight corners.</p></div></div><p class="card-text fw-bold mt-auto">Approx. Price: $<!-- -->1099</p><div class="d-flex gap-2"><a class="btn btn-outline-primary flex-grow-1" href="/reviews/Polaris-F9550-Sport">Read Review</a><a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JJ5I7GQ?tag=scorpiusllc-20" target="_blank" class="btn btn-warning flex-grow-1 fw-bold ">Check Price</a></div></div></div></div><div class="col-md-6 mb-4"><div class="card h-100"><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column"><div class="d-flex mb-3"><div class="flex-shrink-0 me-3" style="width:100px;height:100px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><img src="https://cdn.fluidrausa.com/-/media/media-database/products/cleaners/polaris-p39/p39_1.png?rev=369f337662f24b9ebb56f3a33acc0e4f" alt="Polaris P39" class="img-fluid rounded" style="max-height:100%;max-width:100%;object-fit:contain"/></div><div><h5 class="card-title">Polaris P39</h5><p class="card-text small text-muted">A pressure-side cleaner that works in all in-ground pools and sweeps, scrubs, and vacuums the bottom and walls.</p></div></div><p class="card-text fw-bold mt-auto">Approx. Price: $<!-- -->974</p><div class="d-flex gap-2"><a class="btn btn-outline-primary flex-grow-1" href="/reviews/Polaris-P39">Read Review</a><a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01GWSJMQ6?tag=scorpiusllc-20" target="_blank" class="btn btn-warning flex-grow-1 fw-bold ">Check Price</a></div></div></div></div><div class="col-md-6 mb-4"><div class="card h-100"><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column"><div class="d-flex mb-3"><div class="flex-shrink-0 me-3" style="width:100px;height:100px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><img src="https://commerce.hayward-pool-assets.com/magento/2026/W3RC9990CUB/TigerShark_QC_Robotic_Cleaner_RC9990CUB_LEFT_3561.png" alt="Hayward TigerShark QC" class="img-fluid rounded" style="max-height:100%;max-width:100%;object-fit:contain"/></div><div><h5 class="card-title">Hayward TigerShark QC</h5><p class="card-text small text-muted">Known for its durability and quick cleaning cycle. A workhorse for larger pools.</p></div></div><p class="card-text fw-bold mt-auto">Approx. Price: $<!-- -->1489</p><div class="d-flex gap-2"><a class="btn btn-outline-primary flex-grow-1" href="/reviews/Hayward-TigerShark-QC">Read Review</a><a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SS4G926?tag=scorpiusllc-20" target="_blank" class="btn btn-warning flex-grow-1 fw-bold ">Check Price</a></div></div></div></div><div class="col-md-6 mb-4"><div class="card h-100"><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column"><div class="d-flex mb-3"><div class="flex-shrink-0 me-3" style="width:100px;height:100px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><img src="https://commerce.hayward-pool-assets.com/magento/2026/RC9742WCCUBY/sharkvac_xl_left_3434.png" alt="Hayward SharkVac XL" class="img-fluid rounded" style="max-height:100%;max-width:100%;object-fit:contain"/></div><div><h5 class="card-title">Hayward SharkVac XL</h5><p class="card-text small text-muted">Features smart steering technology for an efficient cleaning pattern and a large debris container.</p></div></div><p class="card-text fw-bold mt-auto">Approx. Price: $<!-- -->1599</p><div class="d-flex gap-2"><a class="btn btn-outline-primary flex-grow-1" href="/reviews/Hayward-SharkVac-XL">Read Review</a><a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SR4M42F?tag=scorpiusllc-20" target="_blank" class="btn btn-warning flex-grow-1 fw-bold ">Check Price</a></div></div></div></div><div class="col-md-6 mb-4"><div class="card h-100"><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column"><div class="d-flex mb-3"><div class="flex-shrink-0 me-3" style="width:100px;height:100px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><img src="https://commerce.hayward-pool-assets.com/magento/2026/W3PVS20JST/2024_The_PoolCleaner_W3PVS20JST_Amazon_Assets_Carousel_02_173e.png" alt="Hayward Poolvergnuegen" class="img-fluid rounded" style="max-height:100%;max-width:100%;object-fit:contain"/></div><div><h5 class="card-title">Hayward Poolvergnuegen</h5><p class="card-text small text-muted">A 2-wheel suction cleaner with patented self-adjusting turbine vanes for maximum power at any flow.</p></div></div><p class="card-text fw-bold mt-auto">Approx. Price: $<!-- -->529</p><div class="d-flex gap-2"><a class="btn btn-outline-primary flex-grow-1" href="/reviews/Hayward-W3PVS20JST-Poolvergnuegen">Read Review</a><a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SPM1Z5X?tag=scorpiusllc-20" target="_blank" class="btn btn-warning flex-grow-1 fw-bold ">Check Price</a></div></div></div></div><div class="col-md-6 mb-4"><div class="card h-100"><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column"><div class="d-flex mb-3"><div class="flex-shrink-0 me-3" style="width:100px;height:100px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><img src="https://www.pentair.com/content/dam/extranet/nam/pentair-pool/residential/cleaners/prowler-cleaners/prowler-910/prowler-910-images/Prowler910-front-whtRT_cr_rez.png.thumb.1280.1280.jpg" alt="Pentair Prowler 930" class="img-fluid rounded" style="max-height:100%;max-width:100%;object-fit:contain"/></div><div><h5 class="card-title">Pentair Prowler 930</h5><p class="card-text small text-muted">A high-speed scrubbing robotic cleaner with all-surface deep cleaning and a top-access filtration basket.</p></div></div><p class="card-text fw-bold mt-auto">Approx. Price: $<!-- -->423</p><div class="d-flex gap-2"><a class="btn btn-outline-primary flex-grow-1" href="/reviews/Pentair-Prowler-930">Read Review</a><a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N7IZSZJ?tag=scorpiusllc-20" target="_blank" class="btn btn-warning flex-grow-1 fw-bold ">Check Price</a></div></div></div></div><div class="col-md-6 mb-4"><div class="card h-100"><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column"><div class="d-flex mb-3"><div class="flex-shrink-0 me-3" style="width:100px;height:100px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71U00J06E4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg" alt="Aiper Scuba S1" class="img-fluid rounded" style="max-height:100%;max-width:100%;object-fit:contain"/></div><div><h5 class="card-title">Aiper Scuba S1</h5><p class="card-text small text-muted">A premium cordless robotic cleaner with caterpillar treads for superior mobility on all pool surfaces.</p></div></div><p class="card-text fw-bold mt-auto">Approx. Price: $<!-- -->579</p><div class="d-flex gap-2"><a class="btn btn-outline-primary flex-grow-1" href="/reviews/Aiper-Scuba-S1">Read Review</a><a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0FNMJMGXC?tag=scorpiusllc-20" target="_blank" class="btn btn-warning flex-grow-1 fw-bold ">Check Price</a></div></div></div></div><div class="col-md-6 mb-4"><div class="card h-100"><div class="card-body d-flex flex-column"><div class="d-flex mb-3"><div class="flex-shrink-0 me-3" style="width:100px;height:100px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71avyX9pZUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg" alt="Aiper Seagull Pro" class="img-fluid rounded" style="max-height:100%;max-width:100%;object-fit:contain"/></div><div><h5 class="card-title">Aiper Seagull Pro</h5><p class="card-text small text-muted">The world&#x27;s first cordless robotic cleaner that can clean the floor, walls, and waterline.</p></div></div><p class="card-text fw-bold mt-auto">Approx. Price: $<!-- -->429</p><div class="